WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.950
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.990
Telegnosis Drops!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.870
Calling for collaborations!

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.580
This is for you, Setsuko.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.130
MARBLE

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.630
DO NOT TRY THIS AT HOME.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.380
Won't leave

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:27.140
Without a dropkick on her

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.230
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:48.290
-She summoned me, the evil god
-Evil god

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.830
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.710
-I can't go back to hell
-Sister...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.420
Yeah, yeah, yeah
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.300
If you go too far

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.300
I'll slice you up completely

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.680
Your halo
Must get it back

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.720
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:13.020
-To attack her from behind
-You're so mean

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:17.150
I'll never give up

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.900
Yurine, you're off your guard!

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:22.990
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.910
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.330
Can't leave Earth

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:34.410
Without a dropkick on her

00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:37.630
But until then

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:43.550
-Let's all have fun together
-Yeah!

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.220
Please donate to the children in need.

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:53.140
Any amount will help!

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.140
Would you like to donate?

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.020
Finally, a substantial amount of savings.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.900
I can finally rent a place.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.740
All that hard work is about to pay off!

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.500
Please donate to the children in need!

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:16.210
Any amount will help.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.790
Perfect score!

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:23.050
Really?

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.630
Did it really just make it in
that tiny little hole?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.220
LET'S HELP EACH OTHER OUT
DONATION BOX

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.930
I'm sorry, it all happened so quickly.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.350
May I get my--?

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:38.600
Thank you for your donation!

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.440
You're a savior to these kids.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.610
Thank you very much!

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:47.240
It wasn't meant to be a donation.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.910
You are a truly giving soul.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.280
Like an angel!

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.740
No, you are an angel!

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:55.870
No...

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.380
You're an angel!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.590
If it'll help the children in need,

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.590
I can't ask for anything more.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.640
You're amazing.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.680
Thank you again!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.230
Ready?

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:22.230
How could that money fly into a box like that!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.650
I'm such an idiot.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:27.690
I should've asked them
to give me back my money!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.330
Except for this 2000 yen bill,
which I sewed into my underwear,

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:37.910
I lost all my money.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:50.130
But it will all go to benefit children in need.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.840
That's a good thing.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:55.220
No matter how poor
or bitter my experience,

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.850
I'm...

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.140
I'm still an angel.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:01.600
I'm still an angel!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:02.850
I deserve it!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:06.440
I'll treat myself to Kanda Matsuya's
curry nanban, only 1000 yen,

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.030
before I head to work!

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.370
Oh, hey, Pekola.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.750
Don't just stand there,
come sit next to me.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.790
I'd rather not.

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.380
Are there any other seats?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.130
Nope.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.680
You're here to eat, too?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.640
Well, duh, why else would I be here?

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.270
I really didn't want to wear myself out before work.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.270
Welcome!

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.900
Curry nanban, please.

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.270
Right away!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:48.730
Their curry nanban's really good.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:54.530
You know those girls collecting donations
by the train station?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.700
Claiming they're helping children in need.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.040
Turns out, it was a scam.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.620
I'm not surprised.

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.750
I just saw them get arrested.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.800
A charity scam.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.170
Two girls...

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.920
For children in need...

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.970
Thank you for your donation!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.850
I can't believe people
actually fall for those scams.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:26.060
Right, Pekola?

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:30.190
Pekola, what's wrong?

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:33.030
Pekola?

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:35.240
Pekola!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.530
Hey!

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:43.200
-Here's the curry nanban.
-Sweet, a Shureimon!

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.420
This is for the bill.
I'll take the nanban.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:49.340
I had no money, so that worked out.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:56.010
-Excuse me, this isn't enough.
-What?

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:01.770
Dropkick on my Devil!
will undergo a transformation!

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:05.690
Now begins, the legend
of detective Jashin-chan!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.810
FIVE SECONDS LATER

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.780
W--WATER...

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.240
I'm so tired of this unbearable heat.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.790
Is Yurine home?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.710
No, she's actually dead.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.920
It's always so freezing cold
with you two around.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.050
YOU KILLED HER, DIDN'T YOU?

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.720
BRING YURINE BACK!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.300
Shut up.
There's nothing you can do.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.430
Take that!
The Hundred Crack Tail!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:50.150
I just showcased
my new killer technique

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.230
on a low-level devil.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.950
You hurt my sister again.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.080
Yurine's gone, too.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:09.000
I refuse to let you live on like this.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.540
What's all this about?

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:15.920
Hi, Yusa, how are you?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.550
Of course you're alive.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:21.340
Make yourself at home.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:23.140
Why, thank you.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.850
I have to sacrifice my snack for them!

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:30.100
A tiny slice should suffice for Koji.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:39.490
We're here to ask you a favor, Yurine.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:40.700
A favor?

00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:42.200
Yes.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.000
Would you please taste test this?

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:48.500
"Hell Ice Cream"?

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:51.620
Since business is slow in Hell,

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.250
we want to start selling ice cream
in the human world.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.340
As a trusted human,

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.180
-we want you to taste test our product.
-Cute packaging.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.760
Sure, of course.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.520
I'm surprised that business is slow for you.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:09.770
You practically have no overhead.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:13.940
It's true, but it's not selling at all in Hell.

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:18.110
Perhaps there's no demand
in an icy cold area?

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:23.660
You're right.
That never occurred to me.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.780
Your sister's kind of slow, huh?

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.620
Let's give it a taste.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:36.040
It's delicious.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.210
-What a relief.
-My turn!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.670
What flavor is this?

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.760
It's Basilisk venom.

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.800
Are you kidding me?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:48.310
Organisms die just by walking near the Basilisk!

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:52.520
You're taking a big risk with the Basilisk!

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.020
You know that, right?

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.480
Well, I don't mind if Yurine dies.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.360
It's all been processed, so it's safe.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:02.860
Are you sure about that?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:07.330
How the hell were you able
to get the Basilisk venom?

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:08.790
That's just it.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:14.710
We already spent so much time and money
producing this ice cream.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.040
Based on my calculations,

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.340
each cup has to sell for 1,000,000 yen.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.710
Think it would sell?

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:27.890
-No way in hell.
-What?

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:31.140
-Did I mention your sister's dumb?
-But, my debts...

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:40.650
Dropkick on My Devil!
will sign with a different company!

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:41.650
WIG

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.360
We're free agents!

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:46.070
Now we're
Food Wars: Dropkick on My Devil!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.160
FIVE SECONDS LATER

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:54.040
I want a high-paying day job.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.790
There seems to be a shortage of those.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.010
30,000 yen per day? That sounds good!

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:07.890
The terms state that regardless of gender,
the candidate must be strong and healthy.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.350
Even without my angel powers,

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:12.520
I'm still stronger than a human.

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:15.480
This job's for me!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:20.650
But why does the job description say "shield"?

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.280
I guess I'll give them a call.

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.030
That must be...

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:33.040
An angel? She doesn't have a halo though.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:38.370
Oh, well, still no sight
of Jashin-chan whatsoever.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:41.040
Where could she be...

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.010
in this Tokyo desert?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:48.430
They hired me without hesitation.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:52.720
But, I still have no idea what the job entails.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:57.140
Though, I'm really lucky
to have found a high-paying job like this.

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:59.270
Today must be my lucky day!

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.650
I should shop for a couple things.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.480
Hey, new hire!

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:08.400
Hey, you're at every one of my jobs.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.490
What? You sound crazy.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:14.580
I'm about to explain the job to you
so listen up, new hire.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:18.330
It's Pekola. I do have a name.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.750
He sounds ignorant as always.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.250
I don't care if you're Pekola or not.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:29.130
This guy doesn't even care
to know my name.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:30.840
You'll be the bodyguard.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.890
Got it? Okay, I'm done here.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:37.680
-Come in, Noel Amatsuka!
-Guard? That explains "shield."

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.940
Good morning!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.940
Your holy idol,

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.980
Noel is here!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:48.320
-Poporon?
-Pekola?

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.860
Just standby here, okay?

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.660
Got it.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.490
Noel Amatsuka?

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.500
An alias, of course.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:02.380
It's easier to get around as a typical girl
who aspires to be an idol.

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:05.750
An alias? What a brilliant idea.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.760
But that would make me a liar.

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.470
You're just too damn naive.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.260
Things are going well for me.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.640
Even though I'm just getting started.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:21.020
Why do you need a bodyguard?
Is being an idol that dangerous?

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:24.150
It's just better to be safe than sorry.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:26.940
Someone might attack during an event.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.530
I'm counting on you to protect me.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:30.900
Of course.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:33.030
I'm getting paid to do that.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:36.660
Plus, you're going out there
as a working human.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:39.370
I'm not just a responsible worker.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:42.250
As an angel, my duty is to protect humans!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.830
Cut the holier-than-thou act.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.420
You always rubbed me the wrong way.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:51.420
I despise all that "angel's duty" talk.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.180
Poporon...

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:54.800
It's showtime!

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:56.510
Coming!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.890
HOLY IDOL NOEL AMATSUKA

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:00.560
NOEL

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.440
Thank you very much.

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:04.940
Your autographed photobook
is gonna be my heirloom!

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.360
NOEL AMATSUKA
AUTOGRAPH SESSION

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.070
What an honor!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.320
Please sign right here.

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.530
Okay!

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.820
Please address it to "Noel's pig."

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.450
I dreamt about this!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:18.990
How funny!

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.450
What a freak.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:43.940
The sky above me
Is covered in clouds

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:47.440
Why can't it be sunny today?

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:52.110
It makes it so hard
To get motivated for the day

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.450
But you know

00:13:54.610 --> 00:14:01.450
It's not all sunshine and rainbows

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:08.420
But there's still not enough time to waste
Just moping around

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:14.760
In a restless world
That's ever-changing...

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:19.050
I don't want to be stuck

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.100
In a never-ending cycle

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:26.810
Of repeating the same mundane routine

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:30.110
I refuse to live such a life

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:33.650
Let's make a miracle happen

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:36.860
And live like the one

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:41.280
Whose life is full of excitement

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:44.580
So, are you ready?

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.160
I'm coming for you

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:49.920
Good.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.090
Seems like everything's under control.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:56.380
What should I treat myself to
for dinner tonight?

00:14:56.970 --> 00:15:00.430
The eel special, or a juicy steak?

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.430
Curry nanban sounds good, too.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.810
I have a deep grudge against you, Noel!

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:14.570
This is what you get
for acting so cold on social media!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:24.330
Pekola, you really protected me!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.330
Damn you, Noel!

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:29.120
You ignore all my R-rated questions!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:31.580
You deserve to die!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.750
What the--?

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:39.470
Poporon, don't just stand there, run!

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.840
Get off me!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:43.600
Never!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.980
You idiot! You're risking your life
for a mere 30,000 yen!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.390
It's not about the money.

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:54.770
Even without powers, I'm an angel.
Protecting humans is my duty!

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:59.400
But I'm not human.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:02.950
You're Noel, a human idol.

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.660
And you used to serve me as an angel.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.040
I'll protect you no matter what!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.630
Shut up!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.470
Where am I?

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:29.430
You need to take it easy right now.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.810
Yurine Hanazono?

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.440
Where's Poporon?

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:37.020
Don't worry, she's safe.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.820
The police arrested that man.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:44.490
We're here because Yurine found out
through a news feed.

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.200
Thank you very much.

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:48.950
We brought bananas, too.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.750
They're not for you to eat, Jashin-chan.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.500
-Don't play with food.
-I can't hear you.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:57.090
You brought this fruit basket for me?

00:16:57.380 --> 00:17:00.340
That was there before we arrived.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:01.920
Really?

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:07.260
I hope today's pay
covers the medical expenses.

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:11.480
The nurse said your bill
was paid for already.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:15.230
I'm taking the melon in exchange
for peeling the apples.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.270
You glutton.

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:20.280
Who could it be?

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:21.860
HEAVEN HOSPITAL

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.370
Pekola, you idiot.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.950
Dropkick on my Devil! Yet another transformation!
Now I'm a flight attendant.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.870
Brace yourself for the overhead dropkick!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.000
FIVE SECONDS LATER

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.180
DAMN IT.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:46.180
UNHAPPY TURN

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:55.060
Here, Jashin-chan, say "ah."

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:58.860
Yum...

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.280
Can't beat tangerines in the winter.

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.860
Oh, yeah, Jashin-chan.

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.990
Teach me how to make chocolate!

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:10.200
Why?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:12.790
It's almost Valentine's Day!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:16.540
Are you giving it to someone?

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.250
Yes!

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:26.630
-Who?
-It's a secret.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.590
Then I won't teach you!

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.390
Oh, come on!

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:33.390
You're a master at making sweets.

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.020
Go buy them at the store!

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:40.560
Valentine's specials are happening
all over town right now.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:46.820
I know, but I want
to gift my special someone handmade chocolate.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.370
Medusa's "special someone"?

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:56.000
-She actually met someone else?
-Not sure if they'll like it though...

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:59.290
All because I'm stuck in the human world!

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.340
What's wrong, Jashin-chan?

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:07.170
Fine, I'll let you know who it is.
So, teach me, okay?

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:09.970
I'll tell you after we're done.

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:13.060
Okay.

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.930
I'll kill the bastard the moment I get back.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.940
This is a bit embarrassing.

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:25.400
Proper form is important.

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.490
That's a tall hat!

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:31.620
Let's be fancy and make our own chocolate mixture
from scratch.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.410
Chop up those chocolate bars.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:35.580
Okay!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.630
The way you're cutting is dangerous.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:47.970
Make a paw with your fist
so you don't cut yourself.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:52.470
-Try it out.
-Okay!

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:57.140
You don't want to gift them your fingertips.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.640
Got it. Am I doing it right?

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:02.900
Next, we'll pour the fresh cream into the pot

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:06.190
and warm it up on medium heat
without letting it boil.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:10.150
Add the chopped chocolate and stir.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:16.540
Pour the melted chocolate mixture
on a tray lined with baking paper.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.500
Then, let it cool and solidify
in the fridge for an hour.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:26.710
One, two, three, four.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.880
Do you think it's ready now?

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:33.970
It has only been five minutes.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:39.270
So, this person's that important, huh?

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.690
Yup, they're irreplaceable!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.310
They're on the hit list for sure.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:47.070
3579!

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:49.820
3599! 3600!

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.820
Finally, an hour!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.240
Look! The chocolate's ready!

00:20:55.620 --> 00:21:00.080
All you have to do is cut it up
and sprinkle cocoa powder on top.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:02.750
Thank you, Jashin-chan!

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:12.800
There!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.840
Jashin-chan?

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.470
What?

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:18.890
Here!

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.310
It's a present for you!

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:24.690
I told you it was for a very special person.

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:31.070
I never saw that coming.

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:36.160
Let's be friends forever.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.740
Thanks, Medusa!

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:43.960
You had me worried there for a sec!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.540
-Really? Why?
-No, it's nothing!

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:49.550
Hey, Yurine, how was your day?

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.720
Hey, Minos, you must be tired.

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.510
Not at all, it's all fun for me.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.640
Just glad to be working.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:00.260
Stop it, Jashin-chan!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:02.680
You stop!

00:22:02.850 --> 00:22:05.600
They're always so happy together.

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:07.650
Yup!

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:34.630
Dropkick on her, yeah her
I'll take you down again

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:39.550
Hate you
Love doesn't exist in this world

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:44.850
Fear the dropkick
An angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:49.270
As she starves to death

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:51.820
It's a love and hate relationship

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:54.110
Can't leave each other alone

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:58.740
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:02.950
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and die

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:05.370
Test my heart, don't stop

00:23:05.580 --> 00:23:12.460
Let's go, dream on
No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:16.840
We're a happy family

00:23:17.050 --> 00:23:20.970
Let me say, I love you

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:23.430
When all is said and done

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:28.020
I'm home
Welcome back, it's hot pot tonight

00:23:28.310 --> 00:23:32.770
Come, gather everyone
Let's enjoy this meal

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:35.030
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:38.740
What next? What next?
In the end, wake up

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:46.290
Devils run, roar, and sing for a girl.

00:23:46.830 --> 00:23:48.830
There was certainly a bond.

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:52.130
Dropkick on My Devil! To the sky!

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.880
Be prepared for the dropkick in the next episode, too!
